# packages/test-app/.env.example
#
# Copy this file to `.env` (same directory) and uncomment the variable to opt in.
# `.env` is gitignored; `.env.example` is the committed reference.
#
# When REPORTING_URL is set, the test-app build generates two additional
# hand-QA pages that send CSP reports + DF telemetry to that endpoint:
#   /csp-cloud-protected.html   (DF mode: PROTECTED)
#   /csp-cloud-reporting.html   (DF mode: REPORTING)
# When unset, neither page is built and the Dev Tools table hides those rows.
#
# Localhost worker URL for /csp-worker-* pages is hardcoded to http://127.0.0.1:8787.

# REPORTING_URL=https://dappfence-telemetry.dappfence.workers.dev
